      "text": "FIG. 1: Determination of m ∗ B q (left) and Φ ren B q (right) using the average of two time sources on the am l = 0 . 02 ensemble. The upper plots show the APE data, while the lower plots show the HYP-smeared data. For each panel, the shaded band corresponds to the plateau extracted from averaging the data over four consecutive time slices. Errors shown are statistical only.",
