      },
      "text": "For the determination of M B q , we use diﬀerent spatial sources for the two choices of link smearing: in the case of APE-smeared links we use box sources of size 8 3 , while for HYP smearing we use wall sources. The local-wall two-point functions are already deﬁned in",
